SUMMARY:WP Beacon and Beyond!
DESCRIPTION:WordPress Lancaster\nThis month\, Austin Ginder will share the
  story of how a wave of malware injections led to building WP Beacon\, a p
 ublic scanner that watches top plugins on wordpress.org for supply chain a
 ttacks. We'll walk through real catches from the past two months\, the too
 ls built along the way\, and where it all goes next.\n\nWhat we'll cover:\
 n\n* The February 2026 reset — 85+ sites compromised in a few weeks\n* C
 atching Widget Logic\, a 16-year-old plugin quietly sold and weaponized\n*
  Why version numbers lie and hashes don't\n* CaptainCore Drift uncovering 
 a five-year dormant backdoor\n* WP Beacon's first live catch — Scroll To
  Top and its hidden update channel\n* How AI made forensic-level investiga
 tion possible\n* WP Registry — the next step. Audit 100% of code\n\nBrin
 g your questions about WordPress security\, AI-assisted forensics\, or any
 thing in between.\n\nPizza 🍕 and introductions at 7pm. Come with your l
 aptops and join the discussion. RSVP here or on LocalMeet.\n\n🗒️ Abou
 t our location\n\n* Free parking in lot off of market street. [See here fo
 r directions to The Candy Factory\, Warehouse D](https://goo.gl/maps/2NFNc
 ZFxQC1qi8M66).
